        DEGENERATE WHILE PLAN == REGS. Both are 32 in this probe, so `ctx * PLAN` and `ctx * REGS` are the same expression and Verilator emits a byte-identical model -- the binary-hash guard reported it as a discard, which is that guard working. The defect it was meant to probe IS scored, by X20, which uses a literal 16. RE-SCORE THIS THE MOMENT PLAN != REGS.
